# ==============================================================================
# Rule Name: Apple-Direct (Custom)
# Description: Baseline Apple system services, iCloud, device communications, and local CDN acceleration
# Scope: iCloud, CloudKit, App Store, Apple ID, HomeKit, Apple Music, Apple Dev, OTA
# Strict Restriction: DO NOT blanket route apple.com, 17.0.0.0/8, or Apple CDN to proxy
# Note: Common iCloud/AppleMusic domains (icloud.com, music.apple.com, etc.) are covered
#       by mature upstream. Custom retains verified domestic CDN nodes, OTA endpoints,
#       and China cache CIDRs.
# ==============================================================================

# --- App Store & Apple ID ---
# Target: App Store downloads, icons, and Apple Account authentication
# Evidence: App Store app updates and Apple ID sign-in trace, 2026-09-28
# Reason: Direct connection to local Apple CDN nodes avoids throttling
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apps.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,mzstatic.com
DOMAIN,identity.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,appleid.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,appleid.cdn-apple.com
# Siri backend (blackmatrix7 Siri.list)
DOMAIN,guzzoni.apple.com
# Apple ID authentication (blackmatrix7 AppleID.list, not covered by existing appleid.apple.com suffix)
DOMAIN,gsa.apple.com
DOMAIN,idmsa.apple.com

# --- Apple Music CDN Edge ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com

# --- Core Infrastructure & Hardware / Firmware / OTA ---
# Target: iOS OTA software updates, Game Center, and Apple captive portal
# Evidence: iOS System Settings OTA update check, 2026-09-28
# Reason: Fast OTA downloads from local cache nodes
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple-dns.net
DOMAIN,konut-cdn.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,swcdn.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,updates-http.cdn-apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gg.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gnip.apple.com
# Target: Apple Software update catalog for additional OS components (ADOS)
# Source: Loon log trace 2026-10-01 | Reason: gdmf-ados.apple.com falling to FINAL causing high latency / timeout (ADOS update catalog)
DOMAIN,gdmf-ados.apple.com
# Apple certificate revocation checks (OCSP v2 responder, fixes falling to Final)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ocsp2.apple.com
# Apple NTP time synchronization service (fixes UDP 123 dropping on proxy)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,time.apple.com
# Apple DeviceCheck & App Attest device validation (anti-fraud, anti-tamper)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,appattest.apple.com
# Apple Wi-Fi Positioning System (CoreLocation indoor/Wi-Fi location lookup)
DOMAIN,wps.apple.com
# Target: Apple Location Services (CoreLocation / configuration-carry.ls.apple.com)
# Source: Loon log trace 2026-09-30 | Reason: Location services configuration carrier check falling to FINAL
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ls.apple.com
# Target: Apple WeatherKit API (Beijing weather query)
# Source: Loon log trace 2026-09-30 | Reason: WeatherKit API falling to FINAL, connects to China Kingsoft CDN cache
DOMAIN,weatherkit.apple.com
# Target: Apple iPhone activation & diagnostics check
# Source: Loon log trace 2026-09-30 | Reason: iphone-ld.apple.com falling to FINAL
DOMAIN,iphone-ld.apple.com
# Target: Apple StoreKit & IAP sandbox testing environment
# Source: Loon log trace 2026-09-30 | Reason: amp-api.sandbox.apple.com falling to FINAL
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,sandbox.apple.com

# --- Apple Maps & MapKit Ecosystem ---
# Target: Apple MapKit tiles and vector graphics CDN (MapKit JS / Find My / HomeKit geolocation)
# Evidence: Loon log trace 2026-10-02 (cdn.apple-mapkit.com resolved to mainland CDN 119.147.195.212 but fell to FINAL)
# Reason: Domestic CDN acceleration for map tiles and POI rendering; completely distinct from apple.com media
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple-mapkit.com

# --- Apple China Local CDN Cache ---
# Target: Official Apple China CDN IPv4 subnet
# Evidence: Apple official documentation on China CDN cache IPs, 2026-09-28
# Reason: Domestic CDN acceleration
IP-CIDR,17.248.128.0/17,no-resolve
